An update reads by field only the hold that is the written record; every other hold of the judgement is read as a
list demand reads it (ownership-v2.md §2.8, a hold that is not the written record; §2.7, the kind `read`; #2443).
Before, v2 accepted `sameField`, `shared` and `sharedTwin`. v1 gives the same verdict on every line.
